 "slug": "insulating-gloves-6-essential-classes-and-safe-testing-tips",
 "question": "What Are the Classes of Insulating Gloves?",
 "body_html": "<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">Insulating gloves are graded into six classes under IEC 60903 and ASTM D120, from Class 00 to Class 4, by the highest AC voltage they can safely handle.</p><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:8px 0 4px;font-size:16px;\"><tr style=\"background:#1a2b4a;color:#fff;\"><th style=\"padding:8px;text-align:left;\">Class</th><th style=\"padding:8px;text-align:left;\">Colour</th><th style=\"padding:8px;text-align:left;\">Max use AC</th></tr><tr style=\"background:#eef4fb;\"><td style=\"padding:8px;\">00</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\">Beige</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\">500 V</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff;\"><td style=\"padding:8px;\">0</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\">Red</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\">1000 V</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#eef4fb;\"><td style=\"padding:8px;\">1</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\">White</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\">7500 V</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff;\"><td style=\"padding:8px;\">2</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\">Yellow</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\">17000 V</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#eef4fb;\"><td style=\"padding:8px;\">3</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\">Green</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\">26500 V</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff;\"><td style=\"padding:8px;\">4</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\">Orange</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\">36000 V</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0;\">Air test them before every use and retest every 6 months.</p>"
}